<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Steers raises interim shr, div.</title>
<headline>Steers raises interim shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     14.2	  vs  10.5</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  7.0	  vs   5.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    3.71	 vs   2.73</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    5.95	 vs   4.54</p>
<p>    Tax			  2.29	 vs   1.80</p>
<p>    Turnover		  49.43	 vs  36.38</p>
<p>Div payable Oct 25</p>
<p>on register Oct 18</p>
<p>Full name: Steers Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
